.TH "GYRO" "1" "Nov 2026" "Gyro Hosting" "gyro manual"

.SH NAME
gyro-account-card-update - Use a card for auto-payment / make it the default


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgyro account card update  [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Use a card for auto-payment / make it the default

.PP
\fBauto_pay\fR true adds the card to the end of the auto-payment chain (renewal invoices are paid from balance first, then from these cards in order), false removes it. \fBdefault: true\fR makes it the default card. Expired cards are refused (422 card_expired).

.PP
API: PATCH /cloud/account/cards/{id} (operationId updateSavedCard, scope billing_pay)


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--auto-pay\fP[=false]
	auto_pay

.PP
\fB--data\fP=""
	request body as JSON, @file or @- (stdin)

.PP
\fB--default\fP[=false]
